        "text": "Design labor, not fab capacity, is what gates new silicon. If agents write RTL, the loop from idea -&gt; bitstream -&gt; running hardware collapses to something like a software release cycle. \n\nReconfigurable silicon stops being a compromise and becomes the fast path: you iterate",
